    {
      "id": 910,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [60, 100],
      "size": [560, 760],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 48,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Shot: a directed shot with sound on LTX 2.5",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Shot: a directed shot with sound on LTX 2.5\n\nRenders one shot from your prompt and seven choices written as sentences: the movement, the camera, the lens, the focus, the light, the color and the mood. LTX 2.5 runs it in two stages and makes its sound. A run with sound off drops the audio track. Built from Comfy's template video_ltx2_5_t2v.\n\n## Models\n\n- [ltx-2.5-latent-spatial-upscaler-x2-bf16-1.0.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.5/resolve/main/latent_upscale_models/ltx-2.5-latent-spatial-upscaler-x2-bf16-1.0.safetensors): LTX 2.5 latent upscaler, 2 times, [LTX-2.x Community License](https://github.com/Lightricks/LTX-2/blob/main/LICENSE-2_x).\n- [ltx-2.5-22b-distilled-transformer-comfy-int8-convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.5/resolve/main/diffusion_models/ltx-2.5-22b-distilled-transformer-comfy-int8-convrot.safetensors): LTX 2.5 22B distilled, int8, [LTX-2.x Community License](https://github.com/Lightricks/LTX-2/blob/main/LICENSE-2_x).\n- [ltx-2.5-video-vae-bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.5/resolve/main/vae/ltx-2.5-video-vae-bf16.safetensors): LTX 2.5 video VAE, [LTX-2.x Community License](https://github.com/Lightricks/LTX-2/blob/main/LICENSE-2_x).\n- [ltx-2.5-audio-vae-bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.5/resolve/main/vae/ltx-2.5-audio-vae-bf16.safetensors): LTX 2.5 audio VAE, [LTX-2.x Community License](https://github.com/Lightricks/LTX-2/blob/main/LICENSE-2_x).\n- [gemma4-12b-with-proj-ltx-2.5-comfy-int8-convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.5/resolve/main/text_encoders/gemma4-12b-with-proj-ltx-2.5-comfy-int8-convrot.safetensors): Gemma 4 12B text encoder with the LTX 2.5 projections, int8, [the licence of the LTX 2.5 repository it sits in](https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.5).\n\nRosesfield ships no weights. Each loader lists its file with a download link.\n\nPart of [Rosesfield](https://github.com/rossaai/rosesfield), MIT. Built from Comfy-Org/workflow_templates, MIT, per NOTICE."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
